      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: That's great to hear.\nP.S. I did my testing by giving youtube-dl the same arguments as VRChat does and then passing the URL it returns to curl to see the download speed (as seen in the picture I posted). Based on that I am pretty confident it indeed is a throttling issue. Anyway, thanks!",
