  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-12T17:00:17.941Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The original version of youtube-dl has a known throttling issue:\nhttps://github.com/ytdl-org/youtube-dl/issues/29326\nThe same behaviour can be observed using VRChat's version of youtube-dl, manifesting in-game as slow/stuttering playback. The lack of maintenance of the original youtube-dl project has created many forks aiming to fix some of the issues present in the latest release of youtube-dl. One of these forks that is actively maintained is yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp), which includes a workaround for this throttling issue:\nhttps://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/pull/492\nPlease consider including the fix into VRChat's version of youtube-dl, or even better, switch to using yt-dlp.",
